Overte Headless-Server (Unofficial)
===================================

This program is an unofficial, stripped-down derivative of Overte, reduced
to a headless, portable, single-binary server. The modifications made for
this fork are distributed under the GNU Affero General Public License,
Version 3. See the "LICENSE-AGPL-3.0.txt" file or
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.en.html for the full text.

