Modifications / Headless rework
-------------------------------
The headless modifications (single-binary multicall server, removal of the
client / GUI, rendering and baking subsystems, removal of the ICE and
centralized-registry dependencies, port-argument based configuration
instead of machine-specific paths, static embedding of the Opus codec, and
the removal of other unused code paths) are:

    Copyright (C) 2026 アケネＪ / Akenejie

These modifications are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License v3.0, see "LICENSE-AGPL-3.0.txt".

Note per AGPL-3.0 section 13
----------------------------
This software is intended to operate as a network server (it listens on
UDP/TCP ports). As required by section 13 of the AGPL-3.0, if this software
is made available to other users over a network, the Corresponding Source
of the complete, modified work must likewise be made available to those
users. The primary source of this modified work is this repository
(https://github.com/akenejie/overte-hs).

